+[A1] [[post-qftx-n2-vector-hypermultiplet-model]]: the vector chiral field is connection-normalized; the hyper kinetic terms are canonical; the hyper superpotential is $\\sqrt2\\,\\widetilde Q\\Phi_1Q+m\\widetilde Q Q$.
