+---
+id: ex-qftx-n2-quadratic-prepotential
+kind: example
+title: Constant gauge-coupling matrix from the quadratic N=2 prepotential
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
