+---
+id: ex-qftx-n2-hypermultiplet-gauge-invariants
+kind: example
+title: Gauge-invariant bilinears in one SU(2) hypermultiplet
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 7
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
