+[A1] [[post-qftx-n4-super-yang-mills-model]]: $V=\frac{g^2}{2}\sum_{I<J}\kappa([X^I_{\mathrm{can}},X^J_{\mathrm{can}}],[X^I_{\mathrm{can}},X^J_{\mathrm{can}}])$.
