+---
+id: lem-qftx-n4-adjoint-cubic-gauge-invariance
+kind: lemma
+title: Gauge invariance of the adjoint cubic superpotential
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
