+---
+id: lem-qftx-n2-hypermultiplet-gauge-invariant-couplings
+kind: lemma
+title: Gauge invariance of hypermultiplet mass and adjoint couplings
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 5
+domain: physics
