+---
+id: ex-qftx-n4-su2-noncommuting-scalar-potential
+kind: example
+title: Positive N=4 scalar potential for two noncommuting SU(2) fields
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
